APPLICATION GOAL

Create a marketplace where verified home cooks can sell homemade food and verified delivery partners can deliver orders.

The system must include:

* KYC Verification
* Trust Score System
* Food Listings
* Order Management
* Reviews
* Analytics Dashboard

